test.yaml:5:3: environment variable "ACTIONS_ALLOW_USE_UNSECURE_NODE_VERSION" no longer does anything: it kept the JavaScript actions on Node.js 20 after Node.js 24 became the default on 2026-06-16, and GitHub removed Node.js 20 from GitHub Actions on 2026-09-23, so the runner runs every JavaScript action on Node.js 24. remove it (GitHub Enterprise Server and old self-hosted runners may still read it) [deprecated-node-runtime]
test.yaml:13:7: environment variable "FORCE_JAVASCRIPT_ACTIONS_TO_NODE24" no longer does anything: it ran the JavaScript actions on Node.js 24 before it became the default on 2026-06-16, and GitHub removed Node.js 20 from GitHub Actions on 2026-09-23, so the runner runs every JavaScript action on Node.js 24. remove it (GitHub Enterprise Server and old self-hosted runners may still read it) [deprecated-node-runtime]
test.yaml:17:11: environment variable "ACTIONS_ALLOW_USE_UNSECURE_NODE_VERSION" no longer does anything: it kept the JavaScript actions on Node.js 20 after Node.js 24 became the default on 2026-06-16, and GitHub removed Node.js 20 from GitHub Actions on 2026-09-23, so the runner runs every JavaScript action on Node.js 24. remove it (GitHub Enterprise Server and old self-hosted runners may still read it) [deprecated-node-runtime]
